# Amazon Sales Performance Dashboard

## Overview
Built an interactive Power BI dashboard to analyze Amazon sales data.

## Tools Used
- Power BI
- Microsoft Excel

## Features
- Total Sales KPI
- Total Profit KPI
- Sales by State Analysis
- Sales by Category Analysis
- Payment Method Analysis
- Top 5 Products by Sales
- Sales Trend Analysis
- Interactive Filters and Slicers

## Dataset
Amazon Sales dataset containing order, customer, product, sales, profit, payment method, and state information.

## Key Insights
- Analyzed sales performance across states.
- Identified top-selling products.
- Compared category-wise revenue and profit.
- Visualized sales trends over time.

